  "instructions": [
    "Peel and shred daikon into fine ribbons using a mandoline or knife.",
    "In a bowl, whisk together miso paste, warm water, sesame oil, lemon juice, and olive oil until smooth.",
    "Toss the shredded daikon in the miso dressing until evenly coated, then season with salt and red pepper flakes.",
    "Sprinkle toasted sesame seeds and chopped cilantro over the salad.",
    "Drizzle pomegranate molasses over the top if using, and give one final gentle toss.",
    "Let the salad rest for 5 minutes to allow flavors to meld before serving.",
    "Serve chilled or at room temperature as a fresh side or light lunch."
  ],
